[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6241.51, "timestamp": "01:44:01", "text": "“是啊，我喜欢跟朋友们打个招呼。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6242.669, "timestamp": "01:44:02", "text": "每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6244.87, "timestamp": "01:44:04", "text": "一年。”然后有几个人在下面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6247.07, "timestamp": "01:44:07", "text": "帖子内容大概是这样的：“没错，100%属实。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6249.03, "timestamp": "01:44:09", "text": "确实如此。”而且还有一些人我没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6252.03, "timestamp": "01:44:12", "text": "还没跟今年打过招呼呢。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6254.55, "timestamp": "01:44:14", "text": "疯狂的。我当时就想，“哎呀，对不起，各位。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6257.43, "timestamp": "01:44:17", "text": "我稍后会跟你打招呼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6259.75, "timestamp": "01:44:19", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6261.43, "timestamp": "01:44:21", "text": "我只认识一个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6264.95, "timestamp": "01:44:24", "text": "至少每月打一次招呼，并且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6269.189, "timestamp": "01:44:29", "text": "那是因为他们……有一天他们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6271.669, "timestamp": "01:44:31", "text": "呃告诉我，“你甚至都不跟我打招呼。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6274.79, "timestamp": "01:44:34", "text": "我。”而且我有点小心眼，所以我现在说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6283.43, "timestamp": "01:44:43", "text": "是的。我不知道。就有点像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6287.27, "timestamp": "01:44:47", "text": "与人保持联系很困难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6292.629, "timestamp": "01:44:52", "text": "是的，我也是这么认为的。对我来说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6295.83, "timestamp": "01:44:55", "text": "没错。我的意思是，我也是一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6298.95, "timestamp": "01:44:58", "text": "你看，我又和大家重新建立了联系。"}]